  "finding": "All 13 clips at both resolutions preserve the pale snout, black eyes, scaled crown and full blue-cloth-covered jaw/chin/neck as one continuous contour. Late death in the opposite side head view is occluded by the arm; paired front and underside views retain the face. Shoulder/arm roots, hands, hips, feet and heavy plated tail follow the torso through locomotion, attacks, fall and recovery without visible detachment. Low and medium runtime transitions retain these connections. All 216 actual technique frames, 24 advancing idle frames and 16 atlas cells were inspected. Native Earth Breaker front and side at .24/.36 plus side Earth Strike, Earth Breaker and Open Wound at .60 show feet and tail clear of the platform and intact whole-body framing.",
